{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2016-09", "window": 3, "start_date": 1473984000, "end_date": 1474588799, "month_true_total": 78, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 01:00:53 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "25641332", "author": {"steamid": "76561198044071847", "personaname": "Western Iron", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198044071847/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 39, "playtime_forever": 365, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 307, "last_played": 1475294704, "avatar": "467f4be6368d7c8b5c56b2a898918e836a7dfaf3"}, "language": "english", "review": "I have too much ammo! AND NOT ENOUGH BUGS!\n\noh wait...I meant that the other way around. Bring a team who doesn't panic. You'll need it.\n\nSatisfactory top down shooter. Not the best, but certainly far from the worst. A shame I hear the community for it is dead", "timestamp_created": 1474578268, "timestamp_updated": 1474578268, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.480427026748657227", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "25628503", "author": {"steamid": "76561198097194143", "personaname": "Slink", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198097194143/", "num_games_owned": 272, "num_reviews": 46, "playtime_forever": 169, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 87, "last_played": 1499833145, "avatar": "a9e8ba5809aeb3474af1f37859da296ee3e1a774"}, "language": "english", "review": "A masterpiece.", "timestamp_created": 1474508213, "timestamp_updated": 1474508213, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "25619580", "author": {"steamid": "76561198212341699", "personaname": "Dane", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198212341699/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 55, "playtime_forever": 143, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 143, "last_played": 1472247089, "avatar": "b93f04b9194fba8980a2dc74947d47d0087ba113"}, "language": "english", "review": "Well worth a look if your into a fun, free, teamwork based game to sink a couple hours into without opening your wallet at all. Just small little gems from Valve to say thanks. Its not a deep immersive game per say as this is just a tunnel and corridor alien shooter game you can enjoy with friends while you have down time between other titles\nAlbiet there are certain points in the game that have weird difficulty spikes which make it impossible to clear without the \"just run\" mentality.", "timestamp_created": 1474466855, "timestamp_updated": 1474466855, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "25616971", "author": {"steamid": "76561198013138821", "personaname": "Namsuomynona", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kthnxbai/", "num_games_owned": 940, "num_reviews": 129, "playtime_forever": 661, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 661, "last_played": 1449565988, "avatar": "9ab90caf86d325a4c5915e3c7db5334d4a722200"}, "language": "english", "review": "short but definitely worth it, tons of weapons and items and different loadouts and boosters, impossible to win alone